Tracing coverage audit for the merge
===================================

Scope: all three semantic tracing batches and the MAC argument/skip refinement.
The inventories record 309 new declarations: 95 + 61 + 153. They are source
interfaces, not a claim that every subsystem branch has a probe or that every
probe has fired live. Linuxulator declarations expand for both ABIs.

